STARTING PITCHERS (denominator: batters faced, approximated)
  stat       players  PA/half   r half   r full  k measured  k shipped
  k_pct          405      517    0.661    0.796         132         70
  bb_pct         405      517    0.608    0.756         167        170
  hr_pct         405      517    0.099    0.180        2363        350

  k is the plate appearances at which a player's own rate is
  worth half its weight against the league. LOWER means the
  signal separates faster, so more of a real difference survives
  into the prediction.

  A shipped value ABOVE the measured one is over-shrinking:
  real spread is being averaged away, and separation is the only
  thing the model has.
